tigation into the nature of identity itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes inspired by Dostoevsky: duality, madness, self-recognition, obsession</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Horror:</strong> Not jumpscares-first. Psychological dread. The creeping realization that you might not be the &quot;real&quot; version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220670/extras/3278dc04e85f84ee236fde9d7be444e0.poster.avif?t=1787154020\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220670/extras/3278dc04e85f84ee236fde9d7be444e0.webm?t=1787154020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220670/extras/3278dc04e85f84ee236fde9d7be444e0.mp4?t=1787154020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Battles</strong> (Strategic decision-making)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hybrid 21 + Tarot system that rewards experimentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same deck, infinite replays, different strategies and outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension between optimal play and meaningful narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> (Atmospheric immersion)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate St. Petersburg discovering clues, hidden items, secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find objects that unlock dialogue and memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth about your Double</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Choices</strong> (Meaningful c